	<div class="col-md-12 order-first">
		<p>
			The Graco 190ES falls directly into this category, being classified as
			an entry level contractor grade sprayer, you can ensure it will last many years. It
			is designed and built like a Graco Contractor sprayer but with the Graco Magnum pricing
			- great value.
		</p>
		<p>
			At Portland Compressor, we carry only the best airless paint sprayers! No off brands
			or cheesy department store stuff here, only high quality airless painting equipment.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="col-sm-12">
		<p>
			Below you can compare both the older version of the 190 ES, as well as
			the new 190ES airless paint sprayer. If you are trying to find a high quality airless
			sprayer at an affordable price, either one of these will suit.
		</p>
		<p>In a nutshell, the biggest differences between the two are:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Pressure Control</li>
			<li>Price</li>
			<li>Looks</li>
		</ul>
